      "created_at": "2018-05-16T15:03:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello all,</p><p>I hope I can get some advice here.&nbsp; I am bringing the game to my college to play with some colleagues before our meeting.&nbsp; I sent out bios of the heroes (base set and first expansion only) to them to choose their heroes beforehand.&nbsp; So far, they have chosen Fanatic, Tachyon, and Visionary.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>I wanted to go last to pick a hero that would be a best fit...any advice?&nbsp; It's my 2nd time playing the game (instantly hooked!) and their first.</p><p>Thanks in advance!</p><p>Eric</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:16.713Z",
