      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Legacy is never a bad choice for rounding out playing this game the first time with others as he makes them the rest of the team better and my secondary one would be Tempest since they have a lot of versatility&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Both good choices.&nbsp; Ra is a good one, as well, as he's pretty straightforward and very thematic.</p>",
