      "created_at": "2018-05-16T17:13:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Completionist Guise, and in the MMFFCC versus Wager Master! (No, don't do that, please.)</p><p>I agree with everyone else that Legacy is your best bet. &nbsp;Also make sure that it is against Baron Blade in Insula Primalis, as that is the intended first scenario.</p>",
