      "id": 218130,
      "name": "rjc917",
      "username": "rjc917",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/{size}/1888_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-16T17:14:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would agree with Legacy.&nbsp; I don't like playing him that much, but having him around usually makes the game more fun for everyone else.</p><p>Do you know who you'll be fighting?&nbsp; If the villain has damage reduction, the Tachyon and Fanatic players might get frustrated without someone like Legacy to boost their damage.</p><p>I'll also add that Christopher has said several times that Insula Primalis is the best environment for the first time playing the game.</p>",
