      "id": 218136,
      "name": "Eric V",
      "username": "Eric_V",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/91b2a8/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-19T14:18:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for this, everyone! We had a fifth player join last minute so the team was Fanatic, Tachyon, Bunker, Visionary, and Legacy.</p>\n<p>We played against Baron Blade in the Insula Primalis, as suggested. It was great fun, with no one going down, though Legacy came close.</p>\n<p>That led us to a question: How common is it to win without a single hero becoming incapacitated?</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:50:11.597Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
