      "name": "pwatson1974",
      "username": "pwatson1974",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-19T14:34:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Depends on the villain, hero and environment combinations. But usually you can do it without too much trouble. Some heroes encourage a reckless playstyle which makes them more likely to go down (AZ, Fanatic, for example) but they also tend to have abilities in their deck to mitigate it.</p><p>The harder the villain, the less likely it is, but even against 4 difficulty you can win without losing anytone if you're careful and a bit lucky.</p>",
