      "username": "speedyolrac",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-11T11:34:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I rarely get heroes incap, and when I do it usually&nbsp;due to poor luck or me trying something tricky. It not the end of the world, there is some synergy with Hero incaps. I have had games where one hero was incap&nbsp;but everyone else was above 20.<br><br>My favorite wins is when there is only one hero up and about to lose but with everyone's incap&nbsp;you manage to pull a win.</p><p>I hope you keep enjoying this game and welcome to the community.</p>",
